<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Questions for those of you who have the new model:<br><br>- Is the volume control still hair-trigger on DMR, going from nothing to suddenly medium loud, and then too loud in a couple of degrees?<br>- Does the radio emit the annoying pops and clicks (which the click suppression and simple capacitor hardware mod were designed to fix)?<br><br>73,<br>--Peter, KD7MW</div></blockquote>V5 radio delivered 2 weeks ago<br><br>Volume control on my radio is smooth.  Definitely not like my 878UVii.  Works great on analogue and digital.<br><br>I do kinda get pops If I have the radio scanning all channels (mix of analogue and digital) and just listening to a DMR talk group in general, when people key up I hear the "pop" if that's what you mean.  For me it's not a deal breaker but it's there.  The click sup option in the menus helped immensely.<br><br>The pops only occur with DMR traffic.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=6488">VK4GAN</a> — Sun Jul 14, 2024 8:57 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
